OL,3,GNEWSACouncil trials AI to detect
OL,4,Apotholes and road defects
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn AI technology trial to detect road
OL,7,Fdefects including potholes has been
OL,8,Flaunched by a council.
OL,10,FWest Sussex County Council introduced
OL,11,Fthe new technology in a bid to make
OL,12,Fhighway inspections safer and more
OL,13,Fefficient.
OL,15,FDashboard-mounted cameras will be
OL,16,Finstalled in eight vehicles across the
OL,17,Fcounty.
OL,19,FThe trial will use AI to identify
OL,20,Fdefects including potholes, cracking,
OL,21,Fsurface deterioration, and faded road
OL,22,Fmarkings, the council said.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
